copy l%20implementation%20is%20about%20a%20thousand%20lines%20and%20contains%20the%20worst%20interaction%20in%20all%20of%20TeX,%20which%20is%20reconstructing%20ligatures%20across%20a%20break.%0A%E2%80%A2%20Page%20breaking,%20because%20this%20is%20one%20continuous%20column%20and%20there%20is%20no%20page%20cost%20function%20to%20minimise.%0A%E2%80%A2%20Bidirectional%20text%20and%20complex%20shaping,%20because%20one%20direction%20is%20enough%20to%20make%20the%20argument%20and%20two%20is%20a%20different%20project.%0A%0AHere%20is%20the%20whole%20of%20the%20interface%20the%20layout%20core%20is%20allowed%20to%20see:%0A%0Aclass%20FontMetrics(Protocol):%0A%20%20%20%20def%20advance(self,%20codepoint:%20int)%20->%20float:%20...%0A%20%20%20%20def%20bbox(self,%20codepoint:%20int)%20->%20GlyphBBox:%20...%0A%20%20%20%20def%20kern(self,%20codepoint:%20int,%20following:%20int)%20->%20float:%20...%0A%0ARounding,%20once%0A%0ATeX%20carries%20every%20length%20as%20an%20integer%20number%20of%20scaled%20points,%20one%20sixty-five-thousand-five-hundred-and-thirty-sixth%20of%20a%20point,%20and%20rounds%20exactly%20once%20%E2%80%94%20at%20ship-out,%20on%20a%20final%20absolute%20coordinate
