copy th%20a%20pane%20is%20likely%20to%20have.%20Left%20alone,%20a%20table%20that%20fits%20is%20scaled%20up%20to%20fill%20the%20measure.%0A%0ADelimiter%20row%09The%20column%20is%20set%0A---%09flush%20left%0A:---%09flush%20left%0A:---:%09centred%0A---:%09flush%20right%0A%0AProse%20in%20cells%0A%0AA%20cell%20is%20horizontal%20material%20like%20a%20paragraph's,%20and%20when%20its%20column%20is%20narrower%20than%20the%20cell%20it%20is%20broken%20first-fit%20at%20natural%20spacing,%20ragged%20on%20the%20side%20its%20alignment%20leaves%20free.%0A%0ATerm%09What%20it%20means%20here%09Why%20it%20matters%20to%20a%20host%0AMeasure%09The%20width%20a%20paragraph%20is%20broken%20to,%20which%20for%20a%20pane%20is%20the%20width%20of%20the%20pane%20and%20for%20a%20cell%20is%20the%20width%20of%20its%20column%20less%20the%20padding.%09A%20pane%20that%20changes%20width%20re-breaks%20every%20block,%20so%20a%20host%20that%20can%20hold%20the%20measure%20steady%20should.%0AUnit%09One%20independent%20run%20of%20blocks,%20shipped%20and%20indexed%20on%20its%20own%20and%20stacked%20by%20offset.%09Changing%20one%20table%20costs%20that%20table%20and%20nothing%20else,%20which%20is%20what%20the%20counter%20above%20the%20pane%20reports.%0AFloor%09The%20widest%20stretch%20of%20a%20cell%20that%20no%20line%20break%20can%20divide:%20its%20longest%20word.%09Below%20it%20the%20word%20would%20run%20into%20the%20next%20column,%20so%20nothing%20sets%20a%20column%20narrower.%0A%0AAlignment%20by%20column%0A%0AThe%20second%20column%20is%20centred%20and%20the%20third%20and%20fourth%20are%20set%20flush%20right,%20as%20the%20markdown%20asks%20with%20colons%20in%20its%20delimiter%20row.%20Wrapped%20lines%20keep%20their%20column's%20alignment.%0A%0AUnit%09Name%09In%20points%09Scaled%20points%0Apt%09point%091%0965536%0Apc%09pica%0912%09786432%0Ain%09inch%0972.27%094736286%0Abp%09big%20point,%20the%20PostScript%20point%091.00375%0965781%0Acm%09centimetre%0928.45275%091864679%0A%0AA%20table%20too%20wide%20for%20the%20pane%0A%0AIts%20cells%20set%20on%20one%20line%20are%20wider%20than%20the%20measure,%20so%20the%20columns%20are%20squeezed:%20each%20keeps%20at%20least%20its%20longest%20word%20and%20what%20is%20left%20is%20shared%20by%20how%20much%20each%20could%20use.%20Drag%20a%20column%20down%20to%20its%20floor%20and%20watch%20the%20row%20grow.%0A%0AStage%09What%20it%20takes%20in%09What%20it%20hands%20on%09Where%20it%20can%20go%20wrong%09What%20it%20costs%0AConvert%09Markdown%20source,%20a%20theme%20and%20a%20metrics%20resolver%09Blocks%20of%20horizontal%20material,%20one%20for%20each%20paragraph,%20code%20block,%20rule%20and%20table%09Markdown%20the%20converter%20does%20not%20know%20is%20not%20set%20as%20anything%09Paid%20once%20for%20each%20edit%20of%20the%20source%0ACompose%09Blocks,%20a%20measure%20and%20the%20line%20breaking%20parameters%09A%20vertical%20list%20of%20boxes%20with%20the%20glue%20between%20them%09A%20word%20wider%20than%20its%20line%20leaves%20that%20line%20overfull%09The%20line%20breaker,%20which%20is%20most%20of%20what%20a%20relayout%20spends%0AShip%09A%20box%20and%20the%20point%20its%20reference%20sits%20at%09Glyph,%20rule%20and%20line%20commands%20at%20absolute%20positions%09Nothing%20a%20reader%20would%20see:%20it%20is%20arithmetic%20over%20the%20box%09One%20pass%20over%20the%20box%0ADraw%09The%20commands%20the%20window%20can%20see%09Vertices%20in%20the%20draw%20list%20of%20whatever%20window%20is%20current%09A%20face%20that%20is%20not%20in%20the%20atlas%20is%20drawn%20in%20the%20bound%20font%09The%20glyphs%20on%20screen%20and%20not%20the%20document%0A%0ALinks%20in%20cells%0A%0AA%20link%20in%20a%20cell%20is%20live%20like%20any%20other:%20the%20pointer%20changes%20over%20it%20and%20a%20click%20is%20reported%20in%20the%20line%20above%20the%20pane.%20A%20press%20on%20a%20link%20is%20the%20link's%20and%20a%20press%20on%20a%20handle%20is%20the%20handle's;%20neither%20begins%20a%20selection.%0A%0ADocument%09What%20it%20is%09Where%0AThe%20TeXbook%09The%20model%20every%20box%20and%20every%20glue%20here%20follows%09ctan.org%0ADear%20ImGui%09The%20immediate%20mode%20library%20this%20draws%20through%09github.com/ocornut/imgui%0Amarkdown-it-py%09The%20parser%20that%20turns%20the%20source%20into%20tokens,%20with%20its%20own%20documentation%09github.com/executablebooks%0A%0AText%20outside%20a%20table%20select
