copy rd.%0A%0AShort%20cells%0A%0ANothing%20here%20needs%20to%20wrap%20at%20any%20width%20a%20pane%20is%20likely%20to%20have.%20Left%20alone,%20a%20table%20that%20fits%20is%20scaled%20up%20to%20fill%20the%20measure.%0A%0ADelimiter%20row%09The%20column%20is%20set%0A---%09flush%20left%0A:---%09flush%20left%0A:---:%09centred%0A---:%09flush%20right%0A%0AProse%20in%20cells%0A%0AA%20cell%20is%20horizontal%20material%20like%20a%20paragraph's,%20and%20when%20its%20column%20is%20narrower%20than%20the%20cell%20it%20is%20broken%20first-fit%20at%20natural%20spacing,%20ragged%20on%20the%20side%20its%20alignment%20leaves%20free.%0A%0ATerm%09What%20it%20means%20here%09Why%20it%20matters%20to%20a%20host%0AMeasure%09The%20width%20a%20paragraph%20is%20broken%20to,%20which%20for%20a%20pane%20is%20the%20width%20of%20the%20pane%20and%20for%20a%20cell%20is%20the%20width%20of%20its%20column%20less%20the%20padding.%09A%20pane%20that%20changes%20width%20re-breaks%20every%20block,%20so%20a%20host%20that%20can%20hold%20the%20measure%20steady%20should.%0AUnit%09One%20independent%20run%20of%20blocks,%20shipped%20and%20indexed%20on%20its%20own%20and%20stacked%20by%20offset.%09Changing%20one%20table%20costs%20that%20table%20and%20nothing%20else,%20which%20is%20what%20the%20counter%20above%20the%20pane%20reports.%0AFloor%09The%20widest%20stretch%20of%20a%20cell%20that%20no%20line%20break%20can%20divide:%20its%20longest%20word.%09Below%20it%20the%20word%20would%20run%20into%20the%20next%20column,%20so%20nothing%20sets%20a%20column%20narrower.%0A%0AAlignment%20by%20column%0A%0AThe%20second%20column%20is%20centred%20and%20the%20third%20and%20fourth%20are%20set%20flush%20right,%20as%20the%20markdown%20asks%20with%20colons%20in%20its%20delimiter%20row.%20Wrapped%20lines%20keep%20their%20column's%20alignment.%0A%0AUnit%09Name%09In%20points%09Scaled%20points%0Apt%09point%091%096
