copy it%20the%20word%20would%20run%20into%20the%20next%20column,%20so%20nothing%20sets%20a%20column%20narrower.%0A%0AAlignment%20by%20column%0A%0AThe%20second%20column%20is%20centred%20and%20the%20third%20and%20fourth%20are%20set%20flush%20right,%20as%20the%20markdown%20asks%20with%20colons%20in%20its%20delimiter%20row.%20Wrapped%20lines%20keep%20their%20column's%20alignment.%0A%0AUnit%09Name%09In%20points%09Scaled%20points%0Apt%09point%091%0965536%0Apc%09pica%0912%09786432%0Ain%09inch%0972.27%094736286%0Abp%09big%20point,%20the%20PostScript%20point%091.00375%0965781%0Acm%09centimetre%0928.45275%091864679%0A%0AA%20table%20too%20wide%20for%20the%20pane%0A%0AIts%20cells%20set%20on%20one%20line%20are%20wider%20than%20the%20measure,%20so%20the%20columns%20are%20squeezed:%20each%20keeps%20at%20least%20its%20longest%20word%20and%20what%20is%20left%20is%20shared%20by%20how%20much%20each%20could%20use.%20Drag%20a%20column%20down%20to%20its%20floor%20and%20watch%20the%20row%20grow.%0A%0AStage%09What%20it%20takes%20in%09What%20it%20hands%20on%09Where%20it%20can%20go%20wrong%09What%20it%20costs%0AConvert%09Markdown%20source,%20a%20theme%20and%20a%20metrics%20resolver%09Blocks%20of%20horizontal%20material,%20one%20for%20each%20paragraph,%20code%20block,%20rule%20and%20table%09Markdown%20the%20converter%20does%20not%20know%20is%20not%20set%20as%20anything%09Paid%20once%20for%20each%20edit%20of%20the%20source%0ACompose%09Blocks,%20a%20measure%20and%20the%20line%20breaking%20parameters%09A%20vertical%20list%20of%20boxes%20with%20the%20glue%20between%20them%09A%20word%20wider%20than%20its%20line%20leaves%20that%20line%20overfull%09The%20line%20breaker,%20which%20is%20most%20of%20what%20a%20relayout%20spends%0AShip%09A%20box%20and%20the%20point%20its%20reference%20sits%20at%09Glyph,%20rule%20and%20line%20commands%20at%20absolute%20positions%09Nothing%20a%20reader%20would%20see:%20it%20is%20arithmetic%20over%20the%20box%09One%20pass%20over%20the%20box%0ADraw%09The%20commands%20the%20window%20can%20see%09Vertices%20in%20the%20draw%20list%20of%20whatever%20wind
